# Working directories — probes, sweeps, logs and pre-images from the build
# sessions.  1,587 MB untracked before the 2026-07-30 deploy, almost none of it
# publishable: `_to_delete/` alone held 288 MB (a half-finished copy of site/),
# `_tika/` 264 MB of probe output.  These are how findings were measured and are
# worth keeping ON DISK; they are not worth carrying in the repository.
_abhia/
_ana/
_appcache*/
_charcensus/
_codepage/
_diaA/
_entry*/
_fnprobe/
_hyphen/
_kankha/
_khua/
_maa0*/
_navprobe/
_pre7/
_pre8/
_regress/
_revbak_*/
_sama/
_screen/
_seam/
_tika/
_to_delete/
_vcache*/
_vism/
node_modules/

# Byte-code and pre-images.  A pre-image is how this project recovers from a bad
# build (nav.json was restored from one twice), so they are kept ON DISK — but
# there are ~70 HANDOFF.md.bak_*, 137 nav.json.bak*, and a .pre* beside most
# builders, and none of them belongs in the history.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.bak[0-9]*
*.pre[0-9a-z_]*
*damaged_by*

# Session scratch under _xc/ — staging copies and pre-images from the
# 2026-08-01 prune. The verification scripts and linksk_fixed/ maps in the
# same directory ARE tracked; only these are not.
_xc/linksk_prePrune/
_xc/reader2_*.html
_xc/i18n_v*.js
_xc/sitemin*.tgz
_xc/linksk_classc/
_xc/linksk_preC/
